  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD Managed Implementation of ECHO funded WATSAN Emergency Response (CI EA 30-2009 Sudan)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This WATSAN project in Western Equatoria State represents a proportion of a larger multi-sector humanitarian response (CI EA 30-2009 Sudan). This WATSAN component is fully funded by ECHO and will be jointly implemented by CAFOD and the Diocese of Tombura Yambio. This grant covers the CAFOD managed components of the ECHO project implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
